      "post_id": "350052643432960000",
      "chunk_index": 40,
      "content": "执行 `mvn package` 会生成一个可执行的 JAR 包，里面包含了内嵌的 Tomcat 服务器。你可以直接运行：",
      "event_version": 0,
      "embedding_model": "multilingual-e5-small",
      "embedding_version": "v1",
      "dimension": 384,
      "status": "published",
      "visible": "public",
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "b7fe8536-6ef5-3470-be3e-d21b2aac6360",
      "post_id": "350057459060183040",
      "chunk_index": 15,
      "content": "- **解释执行**：逐条解释字节码并执行，启动速度快，但执行效率较低。\n- **即时编译（JIT）**：在运行过程中，将热点代码（频繁执行的代码）编译为本地机器码，提高执行效率。HotSpot 虚拟机采用混合模式，先解释执行，再对热点代码进行 JIT 编译。",
      "event_version": 0,
      "embedding_model": "multilingual-e5-small",
      "embedding_version": "v1",
      "dimension": 384,
      "status": "published",
      "visible": "public",
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "9f604828-39c7-39d3-a740-1631f379d61a",
      "post_id": "350057459060183040",
      "chunk_index": 25,
      "content": "此外，使用 JVM 监控工具（如 JConsole、VisualVM）可以实时查看内存使用、线程状态和 GC 情况，帮助定位性能瓶颈。",
      "event_version": 0,
      "embedding_model": "multilingual-e5-small",
      "embedding_version": "v1",
      "dimension": 384,
      "status": "published",
      "visible": "public",
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "3f72f248-8da9-387f-a835-a69d1788fb6f",
      "post_id": "350057564173635584",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "content": "传统 Spring 项目需要大量 XML 或注解配置，而 Spring Boot 通过自动配置（Auto-Configuration）和起步依赖（Starter）机制，让开发者只需关注业务逻辑。它内嵌了 Tomcat、Jetty 等服务器，无需单独部署 WAR 包，直接运行 `main` 方法即可启动应用。此外，Spring Boot 提供了生产级特性，如健康检查、外部化配置和监控端点，非常适合构建微服务。",
      "event_version": 0,
      "embedding_model": "multilingual-e5-small",
      "embedding_version": "v1",
      "dimension": 384,
      "status": "published",
      "visible": "public",
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "7d0c2f73-f50e-3e9f-8142-441ac256710f",
      "post_id": "350057564173635584",
      "chunk_index": 7,
      "content": "最简单的方式是使用 [Spring Initializr](https://start.spring.io/)。在网页上选择构建工具（Maven）、语言（Java）、Spring Boot 版本，并添加依赖：`Spring Web`（用于构建 REST API）和 `Spring Boot DevTools`（可选，用于热部署）。点击“Generate”下载压缩包，解压后用 IDE 打开。",
      "event_version": 0,
      "embedding_model": "multilingual-e5-small",
      "embedding_version": "v1",
      "dimension": 384,
      "status": "published",
      "visible": "public",
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
