      "post_id": "350057564173635584",
      "chunk_index": 23,
      "content": "启动成功后，控制台会显示类似 `Tomcat started on port(s): 8080` 的日志。打开浏览器访问 `http://localhost:8080/hello`，你将看到 `Hello, Spring Boot!` 的响应。",
